WEBVTT

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:08.760
Beyblade...

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:12.310
The world's most enjoyable battling top game!

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.310
The beys shot from their launchers,

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:18.360
and the Bladers' passions 
all collide in the stadium!

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:23.810
Beyblade Burst is...

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:28.430
...the story of the kids who do battle, 
entrusting their dreams to their Beys.

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:33.560
I'll get a Burst Finish with my Shield Shoot.

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:35.560
That'll finish him.

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:37.600
Believe in me...

00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:38.850
Valkyrie!

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:46.540
Go! Flash Shoot!

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:55.330
Hang in there, Wyvern!

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:03.490
I did it!!

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:09.280
I think I was holding back too much.

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:19.620
Was he fighting this 
whole time with those on?

00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:23.100
It's so light now.

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:26.270
Now then! Playtime's over.

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:31.870
Wild Wyvern is the ultimate Bey!

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:43.710
<i>Beyblade! Let's go</i>

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:43.710
<i>Beyblade! Hajimeyou</i>

00:01:43.710 --> 00:01:49.470
<i>Become the ultimate Blader</i>

00:01:43.710 --> 00:01:49.470
<i>mezasou ze, saikyou no blader</i>

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:54.600
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Beyblade Burst!)</i>

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:54.600
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Beyblade Burst!)</i>

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:59.860
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Go! Go! Burst!)</i>

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:59.860
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Go! Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:04.110
<i>Yeah, everyone's got it</i>

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:04.110
<i>kitto, dare datte mottenda</i>

00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:10.990
<i>The desire to win... and a Beyblade just for them!</i>

00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:10.990
<i>kachitaitte kanjou to... kimi dake no beibureedo!</i>

00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:14.290
<i>That's right, facing each other now</i>

00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:14.290
<i>sou, mukiatta hyoujou ni</i>

00:02:14.290 --> 00:02:21.000
<i>The will to become stronger starts boiling up, right?</i>

00:02:14.290 --> 00:02:21.000
<i>tsuyoku naritaitte kimochi ga hora, uzumaitendarou?</i>

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:26.920
<i>Shoot! The throbbing of your spinning dreams (Burst!)</i>

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:26.920
<i>SHOOT! mawari dashita yume no kodou</i>

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:31.430
<i>Burn (Burst!) strong (Burst!), your hearts pound</i>

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:31.430
<i>atsuku hajike, takanariau</i>

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:33.470
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:33.470
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:36.270
<i>When two people (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:36.270
<i>zettai katsundatte iu</i>

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:38.690
<i>who've got the drive to win (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:38.690
<i>honki no omoi doushi ga</i>

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:41.060
<i>battle it out (Burst! Burst! Burst! Burst!)</i>

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:41.060
<i>butsukattara</i>

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:43.900
<i>bonds are formed (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:43.900
<i>kizuna ga umareru no sa</i>

00:02:43.900 --> 00:02:46.440
<i>When it's time for the climax (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:43.900 --> 00:02:46.440
<i>ketteiteki shunkan</i>

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:48.900
<i>face it off... together! (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:48.900
<i>oikakeyou... issho ni!</i>

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:54.530
<i>Can't stop, I'll finish this, with the! best! (Go!)</i>

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:54.530
<i>mou tomaranai, kimeru no sa  sai! kyou!</i>

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:58.370
<i>Burst Finish!</i>

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:58.370
<i>Baasuto Finisshu o!</i>

00:02:58.370 --> 00:03:00.710
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:58.370 --> 00:03:00.710
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:08.480
The Miraculous Shield Crash!

00:03:16.350 --> 00:03:19.320
He was shooting with those weights on?

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:21.390
He's good.

00:03:21.390 --> 00:03:23.940
He looks way stronger now!

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:25.270
That's not fair!

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:30.220
Wakiya looks bigger now...!

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:35.270
Komurasaki has removed the weights 
he was wearing this whole time!

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:37.760
Is he even stronger now?

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:40.450
Is this the end?

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:44.200
This battle's going to get rough, Valt.

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:48.460
So he can shoot stronger?

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:50.020
Big brother...

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:51.220
Big brother...

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:54.740
That's so cool, Wakiya!

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:58.440
You were wearing weights this whole time?

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:02.470
So we're gonna have an even cooler battle this time, right?

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:09.360
How will this semi-final end?

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:11.150
The second battle.

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:13.760
All right!

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:16.080
Gonna use the Flash Shoot one more time!

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:19.570
This won't be like last time.

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:21.670
Ready, set!

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:23.290
Three!

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:24.210
Two!

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:25.380
One!

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:26.730
Go...

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:28.190
Shoot!

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:37.380
Yes!

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:40.180
There's the Flash Shoot!

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:41.570
He did it.

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:42.320
Yes!

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:45.180
Heck yeah! Now the battle's in the bag!

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:48.420
Wyvern is headed for the center,

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:50.060
instead of attacking!

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:52.640
This is the same as what 
happened in the first battle!

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:54.770
No, this is different.

00:04:55.410 --> 00:04:57.850
They clash again!

00:04:57.850 --> 00:05:01.420
Valkyrie sets Wyvern in its sights one more time!

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:05.570
This is a real Shield Crash!

00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:11.810
Over Finish!

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:14.810
One point to Wild Wyvern!

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:16.990
The score is now 1-1!

00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:18.960
Unbelievable!

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:21.840
Wild Wyvern's new move hit the mark!

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:25.360
His Flash Shoot got beaten...

00:05:25.730 --> 00:05:27.750
He even shot it right, too...

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:29.290
What happened?

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:32.160
In order to get an Over Finish on Wyvern,

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:36.520
You have to push it out little by little.

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:41.410
However, by removing those weights,

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:44.710
Wakiya's shoot has gotten far 
stronger compared to the first battle.

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:47.890
Wyvern's speed and spin power are faster,

00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:52.080
so it's able to take Valkryrie's second attack head-on.

00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:59.770
The Shield Crash is the ultimate counter that takes advantage of the other Bey's power.

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:03.850
The stronger the opponent's attack, 
the stronger it fights back.

00:06:03.850 --> 00:06:05.920
Right, Hoji?

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:06.820
Yeah.

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:09.750
Valkyrie's attacking speed.

00:06:10.110 --> 00:06:12.360
Versus Wyvern's own attack power.

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:17.830
All of that power brought out the
 explosive force of the Shield Crash.

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:19.650
This is the fearsome might...

00:06:20.450 --> 00:06:22.320
of Young Master and Wyvern!

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:28.410
Couldn't pull off a Burst...

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:31.390
He's got luck if nothin' else!

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:32.880
Dang, he's strong.

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:34.930
His strength is no joke...

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:39.330
If he beat the Flash Shoot, 
Valt doesn't have any cards left to play!

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:40.760
No way!

00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:41.970
Big brother...

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:44.310
Get it now?

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:48.910
Your Flash Shoot and Rush Shoot 
won't work on Wyvern!

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:53.600
Awesome!!

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:57.040
This is the feeling I need, Valkyrie!

00:06:57.040 --> 00:06:58.800
Completely even!

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:00.240
Nonstop!

00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:02.000
Yes! Yes!

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:06.510
The third battle!

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:11.020
One more... one more Flash Shoot!

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:15.150
This time I'll Burst you with my Shield Crash.

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:17.070
Ready, set!

00:07:17.530 --> 00:07:18.720
Three!

00:07:18.720 --> 00:07:19.620
Two!

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:20.760
One!

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:23.460
--Go Shoot!
--Go Shoot!

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:27.160
Oh my! The third battle starts the same way!

00:07:27.160 --> 00:07:32.190
It's a showdown between the 
Shield Crash and the Flash Shoot!

00:07:33.960 --> 00:07:36.720
No, Wyvern returns too quickly!

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:38.370
He's hitting it head-on again.

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:40.720
Both Beys clash again!

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:42.980
Okay! Shield Crash!

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:48.060
What?!

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:50.010
Valkyrie is unaffected?!

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:53.240
Is the Shield Crash powered-down this time?

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:56.520
They clash again!

00:07:56.520 --> 00:07:59.930
Valkyrie and Wyvern can't move!

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:03.510
They continue to clash in the same spot!

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:06.350
What the heck is going on?

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:09.690
Valkyrie's speed has increased 
since the second battle,

00:08:09.690 --> 00:08:12.320
so the spot where it hits has changed a little.

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:14.350
The Beys are equal in strength.

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:17.890
Go! Go, go!

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:21.940
Neither player is giving an inch! 
What happened to this match?!

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:28.100
If he's looking to draw things out,
 then Wyvern has the upper hand!

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:31.980
Wyvern will continue to deflect his attacks.

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:34.930
It can keep spinning without losing power.

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:39.300
But Valkyrie will continue to
 lose power after each attack.

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:44.030
Uh-oh! Valkyrie is starting to lose balance!

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:47.200
Is it gonna be a Spin Finish?

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:49.520
I can see Valkyrie's defeat.

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:52.350
Which means I'm goin' to the finals!

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:55.250
And he's next!

00:08:58.410 --> 00:08:59.690
Valkyrie!

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:06.420
Wyvern lost its balance, too!

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:10.610
Simultaneous Spin Finish. It's a draw!

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:15.570
Can you hear this crowd?!

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:18.440
This is the hype a semi-final match needs!

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:20.470
Yes, it's a draw!

00:09:20.470 --> 00:09:22.890
You can win this next one, Bro!

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:24.660
You can do it, big brother!

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:28.630
Valkyrie's sounds were shining
 with each and every shoot.

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:31.960
This is what I wanted to hear!

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:35.710
A draw? I had a draw with that shoot?

00:09:36.070 --> 00:09:37.060
Why?

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:40.840
Why is he giving me such a hard time?

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:43.330
Young Master's losing his cool.

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:46.660
No, Wyvern was ahead.

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:48.900
There's no reason he should be losing it.

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:50.230
But...

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:52.400
Yes, a draw!

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:54.290
Just one more!

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:57.810
It's like he has his back against the wall.

00:09:58.150 --> 00:10:00.810
Just a little more. Yeah, yeah!

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:05.690
Valt is still growing in the
 midst of this even battle.

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:12.230
Okay! The first semi-final match is heading 
into the fourth battle with the score tied 1-to-1!

00:10:12.230 --> 00:10:14.640
All right, let's do it. One more time!

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:16.730
This is the end.

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:19.090
I'll end this now!

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:24.000
Ready, set!

00:10:24.210 --> 00:10:25.260
Three!

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:26.680
Two!

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:27.760
One!

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:30.320
Go Shoot!

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:34.560
No! This can't be! You've got to be kidding!

00:10:34.560 --> 00:10:37.010
It's the same situation!

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:40.980
No, Wyvern is faster!

00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:44.350
No no, Valkyrie is faster!

00:10:45.010 --> 00:10:48.100
That won't work on my 
Wyvern's Shield Crash!

00:10:54.020 --> 00:10:57.110
Both Beys have been blown back!

00:10:58.530 --> 00:11:00.860
He beat the Shield Crash!

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:04.190
But Valkyire didn't hit the 
mark with the Flash Shoot!

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:08.190
Valkyrie's not slowing down! 
It's heading for the wall!

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:14.000
If this keeps up they're going to crash!

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:29.050
Wild Wyvern and Victory Valkyrie 
draw with a simultaneous Over Finish!

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:33.010
What just happened?

00:11:33.570 --> 00:11:36.290
It's another draw!!

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:40.730
You did good, Valkyrie!

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:44.690
Let's fight the next one with
 everything we've got, okay?

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:51.060
This climactic match is heading into the fifth battle!

00:11:51.400 --> 00:11:54.620
Why? Why can't I defeat him?

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:58.150
I shouldn't be wasting time here!

00:11:58.150 --> 00:11:59.870
I'm going to...

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:02.330
I'm going to defeat Shu in the finals!

00:12:03.730 --> 00:12:04.980
Earlier...

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:09.200
It looked like Valkyrie sped up...

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:15.200
So cool!

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:17.700
You are just the coolest, Valkyrie!

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:20.240
We can do this! I know we can!

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:25.260
This time...

00:12:25.650 --> 00:12:27.480
You won't be getting back up!

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:29.880
Fifth battle!

00:12:41.270 --> 00:12:44.810
This climactic match is 
heading into the fifth battle!

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:46.770
I need to use the Flash Shoot!

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:49.260
The Flash Shoot should work well now.

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:51.870
Right, Valkyrie?

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:00.290
Just like before...

00:13:00.810 --> 00:13:02.510
Okay!

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:12.290
Let's try this, Valkyrie!

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:16.470
I'm gonna battle Shu in the finals!

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:19.080
I cannot lose.

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:22.390
I ain't gonna lose to this guy!

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:24.610
I ain't...

00:13:25.040 --> 00:13:28.160
gonna let it end here!

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:31.880
This will be the final battle.

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:35.780
That form...

00:13:35.780 --> 00:13:38.020
He's taking advantage
 of his body's rotation.

00:13:38.610 --> 00:13:41.700
Let's go to the finals, Valkyrie.

00:13:42.220 --> 00:13:45.300
My Wyvern is the best Bey around!

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:47.910
Ready, set!

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:49.140
Three!

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:50.280
Two!

00:13:50.370 --> 00:13:51.380
One!

00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:54.620
Go Shoot!

00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:02.350
Wild Wyvern went straight for the 
center with its quick movements!

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:04.520
The Shield Shoot proves effective!

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:07.400
That sound...

00:14:07.690 --> 00:14:10.750
Victory Valkyrie is hot on the
 trail with the Flash Shoot!

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:12.720
It's an intense clash!

00:14:12.720 --> 00:14:15.580
Both of them have been blown back far!

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:18.350
This is a first contact that's 
different from the others!

00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:21.600
That's way too much distance!

00:14:22.050 --> 00:14:23.700
Did he mess up his shoot?

00:14:24.270 --> 00:14:27.110
He pulled the string too hard.

00:14:27.110 --> 00:14:29.110
Can he even control it?

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:33.920
The Flash Shoot won't make it 
in time if it's that far off.

00:14:34.360 --> 00:14:36.640
He'll wipe himself out without 
even being able to attack.

00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:40.690
I don't think you can win, Valt.

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:43.460
Time to go to the finals, Young Master.

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:47.020
After all that hard work, too.

00:14:47.020 --> 00:14:51.980
That's what you get for messing 
up your shoot at the very end.

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:01.810
That's it, Valkyrie! That's the way!

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:11.100
What?!

00:15:11.440 --> 00:15:15.850
Yeah! Valkyrie's got a miracle boost!

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:19.490
This is my real Flash Shoot!

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:23.840
True Flash Shoot!

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:32.940
I'll stop it in its tracks!

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:35.390
Blow him away, Wyvern!

00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:59.030
Go!!

00:16:12.750 --> 00:16:16.520
Burst Finish! Two points to Victory Valkyrie!

00:16:16.520 --> 00:16:20.140
Valt Aoi wins 3-1!

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:24.770
This is a super-super-super-
super-super-unexpected result!

00:16:24.770 --> 00:16:26.230
He did it!

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:27.520
You did it!

00:16:28.600 --> 00:16:31.140
What're you doing, Valt?!

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:33.760
You won!

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:35.600
You won, dude!

00:16:36.210 --> 00:16:37.940
I won?

00:16:38.610 --> 00:16:40.000
I won...!

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:42.000
Yahoo!

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:45.190
I won! I won! I won!

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:47.640
I really won!

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:50.550
You really did it, Valt!

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:51.350
--He did it! 
--He did it!

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:55.200
Valt Aoi beat another fan favorite!

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:57.850
He's not a Dark Horse anymore!

00:16:57.850 --> 00:17:00.670
We're witnessing the birth of a star!

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:05.270
So I'm fighting Valt Aoi in the finals, now?

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:07.610
Now it's my turn.

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:16.970
Those aren't the eyes of someone who lost.

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:22.370
I ended up making one 
heck of a rival out of Valt.

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:34.730
I found someone I need
 to beat before Shu.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:36.560
Young Master.

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:41.470
I'm going to begin training.

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:42.720
Yes, sir!

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:46.750
Something has changed within him.

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:51.150
Young Master will become stronger.

00:17:51.600 --> 00:17:54.280
What're you doin'? Get your butt in gear.

00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:55.490
Yes!

00:17:58.740 --> 00:18:01.950
I tried looking for all the footage 
of Odin's battles up to now.

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:04.430
That's Shu's next opponent, right?

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:05.860
Orochi Ginba?

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:07.880
What now?

00:18:08.630 --> 00:18:10.360
That's Odin!

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:13.490
It's an Attack Type, the same as Valkyrie.

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:15.960
It's faster than Valkyrie.

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:22.060
Obelisk Odin's Xtreme Driver is thick 
with a rubber axis that increases speed

00:18:22.390 --> 00:18:26.380
And the Triple Disc's center of gravity
 is dependent on it's three points.

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:29.820
It gives it irregular movement 
patterns and a lot of attack power.

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:34.320
Over Finish!

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:41.840
It's a high speed, heavy impact Bey, 
even among attack types.

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:45.580
It doesn't matter what kind of Bey it is. 
Shu's going to win!

00:18:45.660 --> 00:18:48.110
Okay, boys and girls!

00:18:48.110 --> 00:18:50.720
We're moving onto the 
second match of the semi-finals!

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:52.100
Are you all ready?

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:53.970
Yeah!!

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:58.810
The second match will be 
Shu Kurenai VS Orochi Ginba!

00:19:01.770 --> 00:19:02.820
Shu!

00:19:03.720 --> 00:19:05.010
Go get 'im!

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:06.600
See you in the finals!

00:19:10.820 --> 00:19:12.890
I've always wanted to say that.

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:24.810
The first battle!

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:37.110
Who's moving to the next round?

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:41.460
There's just one spot left. 
Don't miss this exciting battle!

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:43.520
Shu Kurenai.

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:46.860
You'll fall before my Odin.

00:19:46.860 --> 00:19:49.260
I will go to the finals.

00:19:49.260 --> 00:19:52.600
And I'll make you Burst to do it.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:54.750
Ready, set!

00:19:55.140 --> 00:19:58.530
Three, two, one...

00:19:59.070 --> 00:20:01.540
Go Shoot!

00:20:02.670 --> 00:20:05.170
Both of them have a good shoot!

00:20:05.170 --> 00:20:07.560
Storm Spriggan goes to the center!

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:11.980
On the flipside, Obelisk Odin uses the 
speed from the outer edge to attack!

00:20:12.530 --> 00:20:13.730
This is just like...

00:20:14.340 --> 00:20:16.950
Valkyrie's battle earlier!

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:23.350
Counter Break!

00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:26.090
There it is!!

00:20:26.090 --> 00:20:28.720
Spriggan's Counter Break!

00:20:30.900 --> 00:20:32.730
Yeah! And that's the match!

00:20:39.620 --> 00:20:40.660
What?!

00:20:40.660 --> 00:20:42.100
It's coming in head on?

00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:46.360
It matched the Counter Break!

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:48.100
And continues to attack!

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:03.600
Which one?!

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:05.700
A simultaneous Over Finish!

00:21:05.890 --> 00:21:06.640
It's a draw!

00:21:06.640 --> 00:21:08.230
Wow! Wow! Wow!

00:21:08.230 --> 00:21:12.840
The second match has an exciting 
twist right from the first battle battle!

00:21:14.140 --> 00:21:16.530
Shu's Counter Break...

00:21:16.820 --> 00:21:18.740
He held it back with power alone.

00:21:18.740 --> 00:21:22.760
He held back the Counter Break 
that Bursted Valkyrie...

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:25.790
Was he always this strong?

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:29.460
The prelude's over.

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:31.350
I'll make you Burst next time.

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:34.600
He's strong.

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:37.920
Orochi Ginba's stronger than I anticipated.

00:21:37.920 --> 00:21:38.800
However...

00:21:42.050 --> 00:21:44.530
I won't allow myself to lose now.

00:21:51.050 --> 00:21:54.450
If the Over Finish had 
happened just a moment later...

00:21:54.450 --> 00:21:56.600
would Spriggan have Burst?

00:22:19.080 --> 00:22:25.420
<i>With huge hopes stuffed in my bag</i>

00:22:19.080 --> 00:22:25.420
<i>ookina kibou wo baggu ni tsumekonde</i>

00:22:25.420 --> 00:22:31.930
<i>The train set off towards the future</i>

00:22:25.420 --> 00:22:31.930
<i>ressha wa mirai e ima hashiri dashita</i>

00:22:31.930 --> 00:22:37.890
<i>Holding the ticket to my dreams close</i>

00:22:31.930 --> 00:22:37.890
<i>yume no kippu wo gyutto nigirishimete</i>

00:22:37.890 --> 00:22:46.690
<i>I move forward, without a doubt in my mind</i>

00:22:37.890 --> 00:22:46.690
<i>osorezu ni susumu mou keshite mayowanai kara</i>

00:22:47.940 --> 00:22:51.030
<i>On these long and winding rails</i>

00:22:47.940 --> 00:22:51.030
<i>hatenaku tsuzuku nagai reeru</i>

00:22:51.030 --> 00:22:54.160
<i>Where you get off is up to you</i>

00:22:51.030 --> 00:22:54.160
<i>shuuchakuten wa jibun de kimeru</i>

00:22:54.160 --> 00:22:56.290
<i>Chase it, chase it</i>

00:22:54.160 --> 00:22:56.290
<i>oikakete oikakete</i>

00:22:56.290 --> 00:23:01.120
<i>I know your dreams will come true some day</i>

00:22:56.290 --> 00:23:01.120
<i>mieru keshiki ga aru to boku wa shinjiteru</i>

00:23:01.120 --> 00:23:06.630
<i>Run, keep running, run far</i>

00:23:01.120 --> 00:23:06.630
<i>hashitte hashiri tsuzukete, kakenukeru</i>

00:23:06.630 --> 00:23:10.550
<i>Get past the countless tears</i>

00:23:06.630 --> 00:23:10.550
<i>ikutsumo no namida o koete</i>

00:23:10.550 --> 00:23:13.470
<i>so we can be stronger</i>

00:23:10.550 --> 00:23:13.470
<i>bokura wa tsuyoku naru</i>

00:23:13.470 --> 00:23:19.390
<i>Some day we'll get glory, so until then</i>

00:23:13.470 --> 00:23:19.390
<i>itsuka eikou o tsukamu sono hi made</i>

00:23:19.390 --> 00:23:22.980
<i>Turn your dreams into reality</i>

00:23:19.390 --> 00:23:22.980
<i>yume wa yume no mama janai</i>

00:23:22.980 --> 00:23:27.190
<i>Our endless adventure continues</i>

00:23:22.980 --> 00:23:27.190
<i>owarinai tabi wa tsuzuku</i>

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:39.070
Shu's shoulder hurts?

00:23:39.070 --> 00:23:41.010
I thought he said it was nothing!

00:23:41.010 --> 00:23:43.850
You promised to battle me in the finals!

00:23:43.850 --> 00:23:46.650
Huh? Kensuke, what did you say?

00:23:46.650 --> 00:23:48.540
Did you just talk?

00:23:48.540 --> 00:23:51.050
Please! Say it again!

00:23:51.290 --> 00:23:54.550
Next time on Beyblade Burst: 
"Shu's Test!"

00:23:55.090 --> 00:23:57.640
Three, two, one...

00:23:57.640 --> 00:23:59.150
Go Shoot!
